{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-6","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例论","englishTitle":"If two magnitudes be equimultiples of two magnitudes, and any magnitudes subtracted from them be equimultiples of the same, the remainders also are either equal to the same or equimultiples of them.","book":5,"number":6,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.6","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.6/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":6,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-6@raw-4440e947bc99c40b","contentId":"euclid-5-6","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4440e947bc99c40bd042119d123065b8174d17edcc5840523d727a4c37623d7a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-6.statement","euclid-5-6.construction.1","euclid-5-6.proof.1","euclid-5-6.construction.2","euclid-5-6.proof.2","euclid-5-6.proof.3","euclid-5-6.proof.4","euclid-5-6.construction.3","euclid-5-6.proof.5","euclid-5-6.proof.6","euclid-5-6.proof.7","euclid-5-6.conclusion","euclid-5-6.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-6.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-6","revisionId":"euclid-5-6@raw-4440e947bc99c40b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25d8b4b853429ab224b29453a494bcfa327458d7fb31e999f0c9ca2e9988df0d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two magnitudes be equimultiples of two magnitudes, and any magnitudes subtracted from them be equimultiples of the same, the remainders also are either equal to the same or equimultiples of them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个星等为同倍数, 两个星等, 而从中减去的任何星等为同倍数, 则其余的也等于相同或同倍数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-6.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-6","revisionId":"euclid-5-6@raw-4440e947bc99c40b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34e6c9fc65ab47bf66a3631f7583505082d2756b2f0f9dd8ffdb7ca4dec92c5d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let two magnitudes AB, CD be equimultiples of two magnitudes E, F, and let AG, CH subtracted from them be equimultiples of the same two E, F; I say that the remainders also, GB, HD, are either equal to E, F or equimultiples of them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,CD是同倍数 E,F将AG,CH减为2,E,F;我说,其余的GB HD或者相当于E F,或者相当于同倍数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-6.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-6","revisionId":"euclid-5-6@raw-4440e947bc99c40b","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67d8415162a75c653c2079a80e1ee6669cbc03510246f9af1231460226f531b7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, first, let GB be equal to E; I say that HD is also equal to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,GB等于E;我说,HD也等于F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-6.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-5-6","revisionId":"euclid-5-6@raw-4440e947bc99c40b","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"95a387a36bf9ad20ed001c86e00f50aa38200afdc00ef72a93a5014c8ef695e0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let CK be made equal to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CK等于F, CK等于F, CK等于CK, CK"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-6.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-6","revisionId":"euclid-5-6@raw-4440e947bc99c40b","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0ee28c901461a3fe4205265692cd69fa60a3240b9ef488ec289171674954baa8","citations":["euclid-5-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since AG is the same multiple of E that CH is of F, while GB is equal to E and KC to F, therefore AB is the same multiple of E that KH is of F. [[V. 2](/principles/euclid-5-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AG是E的乘数,CH是F,GB等于E,KC是F,AB是E的乘数,KH是F。 [[V. 2](/principles/euclid-5-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-6.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-6","revisionId":"euclid-5-6@raw-4440e947bc99c40b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"723a59d978005bc1677e0a091c1cb4de8c319e0a4e09c743cf490c648ae6f979","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, by hypothesis, AB is the same multiple of E that CD is of F; therefore KH is the same multiple of F that CD is of F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,假设AB是E的乘数,CD是F;因此,KH是F的乘数,CD是F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-6.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-6","revisionId":"euclid-5-6@raw-4440e947bc99c40b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8cfe81517ad524d55c1179d4c48e147feb3c3226e7e15b6bd6fbd9e121aa097b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then each of the magnitudes KH, CD is the same multiple of F, therefore KH is equal to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,KH星等中的每一个星等,CD是F的相同倍数,因此KH等于CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-6.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-5-6","revisionId":"euclid-5-6@raw-4440e947bc99c40b","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25ff9101224e7158b08e22883caeda655c56a71e356630580515f72a9c1850d5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let CH be subtracted from each; therefore the remainder KC is equal to the remainder HD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每人减去CH美元,其余KC美元等于其余HD美元。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-6.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-5-6","revisionId":"euclid-5-6@raw-4440e947bc99c40b","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3dbd728f85bd30606a0450870ac7e46fb6ca1deaf0f6fb23475b7696f03af9c1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But F is equal to KC; therefore HD is also equal to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但F等于KC,因此HD也等于F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-6.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-5-6","revisionId":"euclid-5-6@raw-4440e947bc99c40b","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ded22ccce254e07004bba0051ce21644d5de8fbf2b5808aa9a125e5c305bf868","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Hence, if GB is equal to E, HD is also equal to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果GB等于E,HD等于F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-6.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-5-6","revisionId":"euclid-5-6@raw-4440e947bc99c40b","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"83021a2413a082e129dd1b7ed55b1314a67409359a194f62bcd06cc2a844d662","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that, even if GB be a multiple of E, HD is also the same multiple of F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,即使GB是E的倍数,HD也是F的倍数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-6.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-6","revisionId":"euclid-5-6@raw-4440e947bc99c40b","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-6.source","contentId":"euclid-5-6","revisionId":"euclid-5-6@raw-4440e947bc99c40b","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"095674b158cf18eb868fe0f25e484ab8fedaf7b1ab2c6bf10dce1e999bf9a2ad","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.6/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.6\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-6:euclid-5-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-6.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.6","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.6/","sourceLabel":"V. 2"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-6:euclid-5-2:explicit","id":"euclid-5-2","book":5,"number":2,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例论","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-ratio","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
